
I’m happy to share that I have successfully completed my **Java Console-Based Expense Tracker Project** as part of my internship at **@DynamixNetworks** 🚀

This project helps users manage their daily finances by recording **income and expenses**, categorizing transactions, and generating a clear financial summary.

🔸 **Features included:**
✔ Add income and expenses
✔ Categorize transactions (Food, Shopping, etc.)
✔ View complete transaction history
✔ Generate financial reports (Total Income, Expense & Balance)

Through this project, I strengthened my understanding of **Java fundamentals, OOP concepts, collections, and console-based application design**.
Looking forward to enhancing this project further with **file handling and GUI integration**.

Open to feedback and suggestions! 😊

